Zero point energy                ...      0.02095651 Eh      13.15 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00141399 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
